  "verified_behavior": [
    "Exact two-arm allowlist fails before client creation, selects minimal episode or corrected independent v2 with no fallback.",
    "Narrow prepared-runner derivation preserves source identity/admission/path separation, one base/work pair, guarded evidence and reconstructed export equality.",
    "Closed phases and exact one-vs-three evidence-container counts required for success. Driver closes on episode exit and attaches result if close fails.",
