    "Provider failures and shared dispatch denial retain known/unknown costs and persisted results without later branch dispatch."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Factory acceptance of signal is not proof it forwards it to GLM transport; production factory consumption still needs testing.",
    "Synthetic Git/recycler tests stub ledger binding and model measurements; separate actual GLM tests do not make this a live matched comparison.",
    "Current ARE third arm, common scoring/cumulative accounting, independent bounded history, exact shared policy differences, twelve-slot supervision and qualification/freeze remain pending."
